        "y": 40
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Time checks start once at least 30 run durations have been exported. They use up to 14 days of measurements and update every five minutes. Workflow types marked **Skipped** do not get time checks because their run time is meant to vary, for example when it depends on how many files were uploaded. Their failures and timeouts still appear. The list of skipped types is managed in the deployment configuration."
